          {
            "title": "SUMMERS AT THE Q",
            "lines": [
              "Battle Tubes takes all the memories of summers with my friends riding tubes at The Q and turns them into a 2-D arcade game inspired by classics like Road Rash.",
              "Filled with over-the-top battles and friendly competition, players fight to stay on their tubes while trading kicks and punches.",
              "Inspired by real events, Battle Tubes blends arcade-style combat with the personalities, rivalries, and inside jokes that made those summers memorable."
            ]
